OL,3,GNEWSACommissioners buy 30 homes amid
OL,4,Asocial housing 'shortfall'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBraddan commissioners on the Isle of
OL,7,FMan have agreed in principle to buy 30
OL,8,Faffordable homes from the Braddan Woods
OL,9,Fdevelopment - which is currently being
OL,10,Fbuilt - to help meet demand and a
OL,11,F"shortfall" on the social-housing
OL,12,Fwaiting list.
OL,14,FThe local authority had previously
OL,15,Fobjected to the development, over
OL,16,Faccess and traffic concerns.
OL,18,FChairman of the commissioners Andrew
OL,19,FJessopp said the purchase would be
OL,20,Ffunded through loans, with ratepayers
OL,21,Fnot covering the cost.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
